{
  "schemaVersion": "story-package-beat-module/0.1",
  "package": {
    "id": "taixu-relics-part1",
    "version": "0.1.2"
  },
  "chapter": {
    "id": "chapter-035",
    "title": "金丹之后"
  },
  "beat": {
    "id": "beat_chapter_220",
    "nodeId": "node_source_continuity",
    "summary": "陆照临把图折好，决定把它交给城里的孩子们，而不是留作顾家私物。",
    "narrativeBrief": [
      {
        "text": "玄霄宗内战暂歇的第二日，归墟盟主抵达回川城。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-001",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6264,
          "end": 6264
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "他没有带随从，也没有乘坐飞舟，只穿一件旧青衫，从城外的雪路一步步走来。城门守卫想要拦截，却在看见他腰间的半枚铜环后，默默让开。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-002",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6266,
          "end": 6266
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "叶观澜站在城楼上等他。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-003",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6268,
          "end": 6268
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“你不该来。”叶观澜说。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-004",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6270,
          "end": 6270
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“你也不该把陆照临带进天门。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-005",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6272,
          "end": 6272
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“他自己选择的。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-006",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6274,
          "end": 6274
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“选择需要知道代价。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-007",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6276,
          "end": 6276
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "叶观澜看向城内。回川城的居民仍在修补房屋，部分姓名牌恢复，部分仍是空白。天门已经闭合，却在天空留下了一道无法消散的裂缝。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-008",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6278,
          "end": 6278
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“你想要什么？”叶观澜问。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-009",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6280,
          "end": 6280
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "盟主抬起头：“改写权。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-010",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6282,
          "end": 6282
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“太虚遗脉的改写权？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-011",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6284,
          "end": 6284
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“不是遗脉，是所有被删去记忆的归属权。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-012",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6286,
          "end": 6286
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“归墟盟想替他们决定记住什么？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-013",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6288,
          "end": 6288
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“总比玄霄宗继续决定更好。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-014",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6290,
          "end": 6290
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "叶观澜笑了一下：“你说得和三百年前的盟主一模一样。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-015",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6292,
          "end": 6292
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“因为三百年前他说的是对的。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-016",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6294,
          "end": 6294
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“可他把名字交给了太虚。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-017",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6296,
          "end": 6296
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“他交的是别人的名字。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-018",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6298,
          "end": 6298
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "城楼下传来脚步声。陆照临、顾长离和慧闻走上来。陆照临面色苍白，掌心残印被黑线缠住，金色裂纹仍在气海中缓慢扩展。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-019",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6300,
          "end": 6300
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "归墟盟主看向他：“你在天门里见到陆沉舟了？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-020",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6302,
          "end": 6302
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“见到了。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-021",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6304,
          "end": 6304
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“他还完整吗？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-022",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6306,
          "end": 6306
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“不完整。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-023",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6308,
          "end": 6308
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“那你还想把他带回来？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-024",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6310,
          "end": 6310
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“想。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-025",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6312,
          "end": 6312
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "盟主点头：“这就是归墟盟与玄霄宗不同的地方。我们不保证完整，只保证选择。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-026",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6314,
          "end": 6314
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "顾长离问：“你们的选择包括把谁交给太虚吗？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-027",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6316,
          "end": 6316
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "盟主看向她颈侧的债契：“顾氏后代，你已经交过一次。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-028",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6318,
          "end": 6318
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“我不是顾氏的账。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-029",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6320,
          "end": 6320
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“可你继承了它。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-030",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6322,
          "end": 6322
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "她的铜针微微抬起。叶观澜挡在两人之间：“别在城楼上动手。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-031",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6324,
          "end": 6324
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "盟主从袖中取出一枚白色骨牌。骨牌上刻着归墟盟旧坛的地图，地图中央有一扇向内开的门。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-032",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6326,
          "end": 6326
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“陆照临，归墟盟可以帮你进入天门第二层。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-033",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6328,
          "end": 6328
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“条件？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-034",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6330,
          "end": 6330
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“把第二枚残印交给我们保管。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-035",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6332,
          "end": 6332
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“保管多久？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-036",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6334,
          "end": 6334
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“直到天门完全开启。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-037",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6336,
          "end": 6336
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“然后呢？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-038",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6338,
          "end": 6338
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“由天下各宗共同决定如何分配被归还的记忆。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-039",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6340,
          "end": 6340
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "慧闻摇头：“天下各宗共同决定，等于没有人负责。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-040",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6342,
          "end": 6342
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "盟主看他：“无相寺只会记录，不会负责。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-041",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6344,
          "end": 6344
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“记录本身就是责任。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-042",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6346,
          "end": 6346
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“责任不等于权力。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-043",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6348,
          "end": 6348
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "叶观澜接过骨牌，指腹在地图门缝上摩挲：“你们内部有人把路线交给了玄霄宗。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-044",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6350,
          "end": 6350
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“我知道。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-045",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6352,
          "end": 6352
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“谁？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-046",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6354,
          "end": 6354
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“你。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-047",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6356,
          "end": 6356
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "叶观澜的脸色变了。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-048",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6358,
          "end": 6358
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "盟主继续道：“不是你亲自交，但你的旧印被复制过。有人用你的权限打开了归墟盟的路线库。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-049",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6360,
          "end": 6360
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“你怀疑我？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-050",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6362,
          "end": 6362
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“我怀疑所有拥有权限的人。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-051",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6364,
          "end": 6364
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“所以你把我派出来送死？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-052",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6366,
          "end": 6366
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“我把你派来找持印者。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-053",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6368,
          "end": 6368
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“找到之后呢？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-054",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6370,
          "end": 6370
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“把他带回盟内。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-055",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6372,
          "end": 6372
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "叶观澜将骨牌捏得发响：“我没有答应。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-056",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6374,
          "end": 6374
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“可以暂时冻结。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-059",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6380,
          "end": 6380
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“暂时多久？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-060",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6382,
          "end": 6382
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "盟主没有否认。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-063",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6388,
          "end": 6388
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "她沉默片刻，从袖中取出一张旧纸：“我替你记着。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-082",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6664,
          "end": 6664
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "纸上画着一条从玄霄宗通往北河城的路，路旁标着槐树、渡口和一座破庙。陆照临盯着图看了很久，直到路线在脑中重新有了轮廓。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-083",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6666,
          "end": 6666
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“这是你的记忆，不是我的。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-084",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6668,
          "end": 6668
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“记忆可以借。”顾长离说，“名字也可以。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-085",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6670,
          "end": 6670
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "叶观澜在旧盟约旁抬头：“但借来的东西，总有一天要还。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-086",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6672,
          "end": 6672
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆照临把纸折好：“那就等我还得起的时候。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-087",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6674,
          "end": 6674
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "总坛外的青光越来越近，石门上的旧字一笔笔亮起。归墟盟主抬手封住入口，回头看向陆照临。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-088",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6676,
          "end": 6676
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“金丹之后，你不能再假装只是追查父亲。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-089",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6678,
          "end": 6678
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "金丹之后，陆照临第一次感到修为像一件不合身的衣服。灵力变强，身体却记得每一次受伤。他在河边试着收灯，水面浮出叔父留下的木舟。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-090",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6680,
          "end": 6680
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "后来者可以从这里开始，也可以选择另一条路。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-091",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6682,
          "end": 6682
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "归来。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-092",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6684,
          "end": 6684
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "河边木舟顺流而下，船底擦过一块暗礁，露出藏在水下的石匣。陆照临潜入寒水取出石匣，里面是叔父年轻时写的修灯图。图上每一处改动都标着日期，最后一笔停在他离开北河城的那天。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-093",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6686,
          "end": 6686
        }
      }
    ],
